xcheck 1
# Section 7 row: "invisible layers" (libliftoff drops alpha-0 layers from the search; how
# core treats alpha 0 was not checked in the design).
# Frames, model setting, predicted class (all INFERRED; nothing has been run). Per the design
# these frames are compared with the invisible layers removed, as a separate class.
#   six-visible-plus-hidden  structural and full: liftoff accepts (it places the six visible
#                            layers). Core: UNKNOWN. If core counts the alpha-0 layer it has 7
#                            layers for 6 planes and reports NoPlane (class liftoff-only); if
#                            it drops it, both-accept. The frame decides the question.
#   hidden-only              liftoff places nothing and needs no plane; core: unknown
#                            (both-accept if dropped, else core-error or both-reject).
#   hidden-in-middle         both-accept expected under either behaviour (control, 3 layers).
origin synthetic 2026-11-28 imitates the profile.rs Imx95Dpu unit-test stream
